{"title":"Career Roadmap · Political Consultant","role":"Political Consultant","summary":"A BA in Political Science provides a strong foundation for political research, public policy, governance, elections, political communication and campaign strategy. However, Political Consultant is a broad professional role rather than a regulated entry-level designation.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA graduate can enter political consulting through roles such as Research Associate, Political Analyst, Campaign Associate, Policy Research Associate, Constituency Analyst or Political Communications Associate, and progress toward consulting responsibilities."},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, practical experience in political research, data analysis, constituency analysis, campaign strategy, communication and public policy is often as important as the degree."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build political science, research, writing, data and communication foundations; complete internships"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Enter political consulting, policy research, campaign management, political communications or governance roles"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Political Consultant, Campaign Strategist, Policy Consultant or Senior Political Analyst"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Senior Consultant, Campaign Director, Political Strategy Lead, Public Policy Advisor or Governance Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the BA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Political Science","Research","Data","Communication","Public Policy","Field Understanding"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Political Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indian Constitution"},{"t