riptive political science toward evidence-based analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Survey design"},{"text":"Questionnaire development"},{"text":"Sampling basics"},{"text":"Political polling"},{"text":"Electoral data"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Political data projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"h","text":"Election Analysis Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible variables:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vote share"},{"text":"Winning margin"},{"text":"Turnout"},{"text":"Candidate performance"},{"text":"Party performance"},{"text":"Historical trends"},{"text":"Constituency-level comparisons"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid treating historical correlations as proof of voter motivation; political data requires careful interpretation."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Consulting & Campaign Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should connect academic knowledge with professional political work."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Campaign strategy"},{"text":"Political communication"},{"text":"Message development"},{"text":"Public opinion"},{"text":"Media analysis"},{"text":"Social media strategy"},{"text":"Stakeholder analysis"},{"text":"Constituency research"},{"text":"Ground campaigns"},{"text":"Issue mapping"},{"text":"Policy communication"},{"text":"Presentation to decision-makers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year project ideas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constituency-Level Electoral Analysis"},{"text":"Youth Political Participation in India"},{"text":"Impact of Social Media on Political Communication"},{"text":"Public Opinion and Election Campaigns"},{"text":"Comparative Analysis of Electoral Campaigns"},{"text":"Urban Governance and Citizen Priorities"},{"text":"Local Governance and Public Service Delivery"},{"text":"Political Communication in the Digital Era"},{"text":"Data-Driven Election Campaigning"},{"text":"Public Policy and Electoral Outcomes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Political Consulting Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"A consultant may work across several stages:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Data Collection","Issue Identification","Public Opinion","Segmentation","Strategy","Messaging","Campaign Execution","Monitoring","Evaluation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Suppose a campaign is concerned about declining youth engagement."},{"type":"p","text":"The consultant could:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analyse demographic data."},{"text":"Study historical turnout."},{"text":"Conduct ethical surveys."},{"text":"Identify major youth concerns."},{"text":"Segment audiences."},{"text":"Analyse existing communication."},{"text":"Recommend communication themes."},{"text":"Monitor campaign response."},{"text":"Measure engagement."},{"text":"Modify strategy based on evidence."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The consultant's role is therefore broader than simply creating political advertisements."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant internships include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Political consulting"},{"text":"Election research"},{"text":"Campaign management"},{"text":"Political research"},{"text":"Public policy"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Government policy research"},{"text":"Legislative research"},{"text":"Public affairs"},{"text":"Political communications"},{"text":"Survey research"},{"text":"Opinion polling"},{"text":"Governance consulting"},{"text":"Social impact organisations"},{"text":"Public administration"},{"text":"Journalism/political research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"High-value internship combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Political Research","Data Analysis","Field Research"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"is particularly useful for an aspiring political consultant."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level C