ical Analyst / Senior Research Associate / Strategy Associate"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Political Consultant / Campaign Strategist / Policy Consultant"}],[{"text":"7–12 years"},{"text":"Senior Political Consultant / Strategy Lead / Policy Lead"}],[{"text":"12–20 years"},{"text":"Campaign Director / Senior Advisor / Political Strategy Director / Public Policy Director"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For Political Consultant, the strongest profile is not simply BA Political Science + political knowledge. A competitive modern profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Political Science","Electoral Research","Public Policy","Data Analytics","Constituency Research","Strategic Communication","Field Experience","AI Literacy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The most practical entry route is usually:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Political Science","Political Research/Campaign/Policy Internship","Research or Campaign Associate","Political Analyst/Strategy Associate","Political Consultant"]},{"type":"p","text":"For students who want a broader and more stable career portfolio, combining political science with data analytics or public policy is especially valuable because it opens opportunities across political consulting, think tanks, government projects, public affairs and policy research."}]}]}